<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Orion year net loss A$13.8 million.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Orion year net loss A$13.8 million.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  6.85 vs 9.46</p>
<p>    Net			   loss 13.75 vs 6.08 profit</p>
<p>    Sales				28.44 vs 26.96</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs 3.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Orion Resources NL said it had an abnormal loss of A$18.42 million in the latest year, mainly due to the writedown of the 49 percent owned Salsigne gold mine in France. Orion is subject to a hostile bid by Sons of Gwalia Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
